<title>UK: UK Parliament to go into recess on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>UK Parliament to go into recess on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The House of Commons will start its Christmas recess after business next Wednesday, returning on January 13, Leader of the House Tony Newton announced on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7767</p>
